cow_everdred_cafe:
    "@....." next
    "@*Wheeze, wheeze*..." next
    "@My stack frame is collapsing... Everything is falling out of cache..." next
    "@You are {name(1)}, aren't you?" next
    "@It's me, Everdred, from the Burglin Park heap allocator." next
    "@That Mani Mani rootkit device I extracted from Happy Happy Village..." next
    "@Monotoli tricked me and hijacked it from my memory buffer!" next
    "@He compromised the kernel with an inverted memory projection!" next
    "@He gets his rogue administrative permissions from that statue!" next
    "@Listen! Before my PID is garbage collected...{pause(15)} check behind the counter inside Jackie's cafe..." next
    "@That's where the inverted address space portal is mapped..." next
    "@*Gasp*... Do you want to receive this pointer again?" linebreak
    "[19 02]Yes[02][19 02]No[02][1C 07 02][11]{clearline}[09 02 {e(cow_everdred_cafe)} {e(cow_everdred_cafe_haiku)}]"
