cow_monotoli_confess:
    "@Let me disclose the kernel audit logs." next
    "@The Mani Mani device generates an inverted memory projection that weakens logical reasoning." next
    "@The power terrified me, so I quarantined the artifact behind the counter at Jackie's Cafe." next
